                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mikaiya ayasuka ati, “Namona abena Israeli bonse nabasalangana bonse mu mpili nge mpaanga ishabula kacema, kabili Yawe asosa ati, ‘Aba bantu tabakwata shikulwibo. Lekeni cila umo abwelele ku ŋanda yakwe umutende.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
